        "original_id": "1e67be00-0323-56d0-a2f2-c445a83f1f25",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tove Jansson\n- Products: Comet in Moominland, Moomins and the Comet Chase, The Moomins\n- Topics: Moomin books, art exhibitions\n\nFacts:\n- In 1943, Tove Jansson held her first solo art exhibition.\n- Comet in Moominland is the second book in Tove Jansson's Moomin book series.\n- Comet in Moominland has the Swedish titles \"Kometjakten,\" \"Mumintrollet på kometjakt,\" and \"Kometen kommer.\"\n- The Moomins is a TV series that was animated at Se-ma-for in Poland from 1977 to 1982.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase is a 2010 3D stop-motion animated fantasy adventure comedy family film.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase was compiled from The Moomins episodes based on Comet in Moominland.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase was restored and re-soundtracked with multiple voice actors replacing the single narrator.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "dfba7612-1f26-58ac-a530-a5ba6df359bb",
        "text": "Page: Comet in Moominland. Sentence: Comet in Moominland (Swedish: \"Kometjakten\" / \"Mumintrollet på kometjakt\" / \"Kometen kommer\") is the second in Tove Jansson's series of Moomin books.\nPage: Tove Jansson. Sentence: Her first solo art exhibition was in 1943.\nPage: Moomins and the Comet Chase. Sentence: Moomins and the Comet Chase is a 2010 3D stop motion animated fantasy adventure comedy family film compiled from the \"Comet in Moominland\"-based episodes of the 1977–1982 \"The Moomins\" TV series animated at Se-ma-for in Poland, restored and re-soundtracked with multiple voice actors replacing the single narrator.",
